# 100_sjira_workorder fail witness: an OPEN residual with no work order, a malformed one, a blank falsifier, a duplicate id, an orphan, a delta mismatch and a promoted standing.
# Synthetic data only (example.invalid IRIs). Loaded together with ontology.ttl by the gate court.

